// Copy to Secrets.xcconfig in this folder -- git ignores that name -- and fill
// in the values from the Supabase dashboard: Project Settings > API Keys.
//
// Only the public client key belongs here (publishable, or the legacy anon
// key). Never the service_role or secret key: this value ends up in the app.
//
// `//` starts a comment in an xcconfig file, hence the `$()` inside the URL.
SUPABASE_URL = https:/$()/your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = your-publishable-or-anon-key
